.TH MU2EUTIL 1 "2026-10-06" "mu2e-pcie-utils 9.01.00" "Mu2e DAQ Manual"
.SH NAME
mu2eUtil \- DTC DMA, detector-emulator and clock test utility
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mu2eUtil
.RI [ options ]
.I operation
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I operation
is one of
.BR read_data ,
.BR toggle_serdes ,
.BR reset_ddr ,
.BR reset_detemu ,
.BR verify_simfile ,
.BR verify_stream ,
.BR buffer_test ,
.BR read_release ,
.BR program_clock ,
.BR dma_info .
The usage text also lists
.B reset_ddrread
and
.BR loopback ,
which are not implemented (they print
.B "Unrecognized operation"
and the usage).
.TP
.B buffer_test
Send requests (DTC CFO emulator, or
.B DTCSoftwareCFO
with
.BR \-e )
and read DAQ DMA buffers, checking each for the 0xCAFE/0xDEAD timeout markers.
.TP
.B verify_stream
Read and verify the DMA stream.
.TP
.BR read_data ", " read_release
Read DAQ DMA buffers; release them.
.TP
.B verify_simfile
Check that the detector-emulator file landed in DTC DDR memory.
.TP
.BR reset_ddr ", " reset_detemu ", " toggle_serdes
Reset DDR / detector emulator; toggle SERDES clock.
.TP
.B program_clock
Program oscillator
.B \-C
to frequency
.BR \-F .
.TP
.B dma_info
Print the driver's DMA ring metadata
.RB ( mu2edev::meta_dump() );
does not reconfigure the card.
.SH OPTIONS
Values may be attached
.RB ( \-n5 ,
.BR \-n=5 )
or separate.
.TP
.BI \-n " num"
Repetitions (default 1).
.TP
.BI \-o " ts"
Starting event-window tag (48 bits).
.TP
.B \-i
Do not increment the tag.
.TP
.B \-S
Synchronous request mode.
.TP
.BI \-d " us"
Delay between tests.
.TP
.BI \-D " n"
CFO request delay interval.
.TP
.BI \-c " n"
Debug packets to request.
.TP
.B \-N
Do not set the debug flag in data requests.
.TP
.BI \-b " n"
Data blocks per event.
.TP
.BI \-E " n"
Events per DMA block.
.TP
.BI \-a " n"
Requests to send ahead of reads.
.TP
.BI \-q " n"
Quiet; limit buffer dumps to
.I n
packets.
.TP
.B \-Q
Really quiet.
.TP
.B \-s
Stop on SERDES error.
.TP
.B \-e
Use the software CFO instead of the DTC CFO emulator.
.TP
.BR \-t ", " \-T " \fIn\fP"
Debug-type handling.
.TP
.BI \-f " file"
Raw output file (appended).
.TP
.B \-H
Write DMA headers to the raw file.
.TP
.B \-p
Load
.B DTCLIB_SIM_FILE
into the DTC and enable detector-emulator mode.
.TP
.BI \-P " file"
Intended to load
.IR file ;
the value is parsed as an integer and assigned to a
.BR std::string ,
so the file name is lost (use
.B \-p
with
.BR DTCLIB_SIM_FILE ).
.TP
.B \-G
Enable detector-emulator mode.
.TP
.BI \-r " mask"
ROC mask, one hex nibble per link (default 0x1).
.TP
.BI \-F " Hz"
Frequency for
.B program_clock
(default 166666667).
.TP
.BI \-C " n"
Clock: 0 SERDES, 1 DDR, 2 Timing.
.TP
.BI \-v " ver"
Expected design version; mismatch throws.
.TP
.B \-V
Skip sim-file verification.
.TP
.BI \-\-dtc " n"
Card index (default
.BR DTCLIB_DTC ,
else 0).
.TP
.BI \-\-timestamp\-list " file"
Request the tags listed in
.IR file .
.TP
.B \-\-cfoDRP
Data-request packets from the CFO emulator.
.TP
.BI \-\-heartbeats " n"
Heartbeats after each request.
.TP
.BI \-\-binary\-file\-mode " file"
Write DMA sizes and data to
.IR file .
.TP
.BR \-\-stop\-verify ", " \-\-stop\-on\-timeout ", " \-\-extra\-reads " \fIn\fP"
Verification controls.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Usage, exit 0; an unknown option also prints the usage and exits 0.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0, including for an unrecognised operation.
Uncaught library exceptions abort the process.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B DTCLIB_DTC
Default card.
.TP
.B DTCLIB_SIM_ENABLE
Overrides the mode (see
.BR DTCRegDump (1));
.B make_test_file.sh
sets it to
.B E
to drive the software simulator.
.TP
.B DTCLIB_SIM_FILE
Detector-emulator input for
.BR \-p .
.TP
.BR DTCLIB_NUM_TRACKER_BLOCKS ", " DTCLIB_NUM_CALORIMETER_BLOCKS ", " DTCLIB_NUM_CALORIMETER_HITS ", " DTCLIB_NUM_CRV_BLOCKS
Simulator event content.
.SH WARNINGS
This tool constructs
.B DTCLib::DTC
in mode
.B DTC_SimMode_NoCFO
without
.BR skipInit .
Construction therefore reconfigures the card before the requested operation
runs, even for a read: for each of the six ROC links it enables the link if its
nibble in the ROC mask is set, otherwise disables the link and its ROC emulator;
it clears SERDES loopback and the ROC emulator on every link, and sets the
CFO-emulation bit (bit 15 of 0x9100).
Do not run it against a card that belongs to a running partition.
.B dma_info
and
.B program_clock
are the exceptions
.RB ( program_clock
uses
.BR skipInit ).
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
mu2eUtil \-\-dtc 0 dma_info
DTCLIB_SIM_ENABLE=E mu2eUtil \-Q \-n 10000 \e
    \-\-binary\-file\-mode DTC_packets.bin buffer_test
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR rocUtil (1),
.BR make_test_file.sh (1),
.BR Setup_DTC.sh (1),
.BR libDTCInterface (3)
